contacts.texte:
Ulti only connects to:

• your IPTV provider, to play your channels, movies, series and TV guide. It's the service you chose: neither the developer nor a partner of the developer;
• The Movie Database (TMDB), to show posters and summaries. The app only sends the title and year of the works shown, and the device's language and region: no identifier, and nothing you type in search;
• Apple, for Premium purchases and, if you turn it on, for iCloud sync.

